msgstr "Modo de compatibilidade"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:287
msgid "Modern"
msgstr "Moderno"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:287
msgid "Intermediate"
msgstr "Imediato"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:289
msgid ""
"The compatibility mode determines which ciphersuite and TLS versions are "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"O modo de contabilidade determina quais ciphersuites e versões TLS são "
"suportadas."

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:290
msgid ""
"Modern is for modern clients only (post FF 27, Chrome 22, IE 11 etc.). If "
"you need to support older clients use the Intermediate setting."
msgstr ""
"Moderno é para clientes modernos apenas (pós FF 27, Chrome 22, IE 11 etc.). "
"Se precisar de suporte para clientes antigos use configurações "
"intermediarias."

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:291
#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:312
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Atenção"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:292
msgid "Clients like IE 6 and Java 6 are not supported anymore!"
msgstr "Clients like IE 6 and Java 6 are not supported anymore!"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:293
msgid "The compatibility mode is based on"
msgstr "Modo de compatibilidade baseado no"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:294
msgid "documentation"
msgstr "Documentação"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:299
msgid "DHParams key size"
msgstr "Tamanho das chaves DHParams"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:302
msgid ""
"DH parameters are used for temporary/ephemeral DH key exchanges. They "
"improve security by enabling the use of DHE ciphers."
msgstr ""
"Parametros DH são usados para trocas de chaves DH temporarias/efemeras. "
"Essas provem segurança habilitando uso de cifras DHE."

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:306
msgid "Disable session resumption (caching)"
msgstr "Disable session resumption (caching)"

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:307
msgid "Don't allow session reuse."
msgstr "Não permitir reuso de sessão."

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:311
msgid ""
"The current recommendation for web servers is to enable session resumption "
"and benefit from the performance improvement, but to restart servers daily "
"when possible. This ensure that sessions get purged and ticket keys get "
"renewed on a regular basis."
msgstr ""
"A recomendação atual para servidores web é permitir a retomada da sessão e "
"beneficiar da melhoria do desempenho, mas para reiniciar os servidores "
"diariamente quando possível. Este garantir que as sessões se purgado e as "
"chaves do bilhete se renovam em uma base regular."

#: files/usr/local/www/webfilter/wf_reverse_general.php:313
msgid ""
"Disabling session resumption will increase the clients latency and the "
"server load but can improve security for Perfect Forward Secrecy (DHE and "
"ECDH)."
msgstr ""
"A desativação retomada sessão vai aumentar os clientes latência ea carga do "
"servidor, mas pode melhorar a segurança de Perfect Forward Secrecy (DHE e "
"ECDH)."

